Author: loop-bench <loop-bench@localhost>
Date:   Mon Oct 19 23:21:16 2026 +0200

    feat(orchestrator): accumulate usage across all tool rounds

    `afterModelResponse` previously received only the last provider call's
    usage. It now receives the sum of every round in the turn, so a
    multi-round tool turn is fully accounted rather than under-counted.
    A turn with no tool calls is identical to before. `undefined` is still
    passed when no round reported usage.

    Closes re-cinq/HALEngine#93

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

